,"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs from 1951 to 2025, 75 years. On the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids, January to February came in under 90% of normal in 38 of those years. February to March on the middle came in at 34% of normal in 2025 and at 36% in 2026 so far. Every grid had its driest year in 1988, and grid 24138 got 48% of normal that year.</p>"}
